# F4: the title screen's menu and quitting.  L twice: billing 3 (Double: the
# gaps show, $250 a track); S: sound off.  1 starts, Space skips the card,
# then ride (Esc counts only with no game key held): Esc asks "QUIT TO THE TITLE? Y/N", N rides on; Esc again, Y goes
# back to the title, where S turns the sound back on.
5 L
10 L
15 S
25 1
30 jump
31-90 accel
100 quit
110 N
115-140 accel
150 quit
160 Y
180 S
